      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igazi lenu, okutsho ukuphila kwenu, ngizalibiza; kuzo zonke inyamazana ngizalibiza; kuwo wonke umuntu ngizabiza ukuphila kwakhe, okomunye kube sesandleni somunye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochitha igazi lomuntu, igazi lakhe lizachithwa ngabantu; ngoba uNkulunkulu wamenza umuntu ngomfanekiso wakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 20:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho zalani lina, lande, libe banengi emhlabeni, livame kuwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.1.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 1:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu wasekhuluma kuNowa lamadodana akhe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wathi: Khangelani, ngiyamisa isivumelwano sami lani lenzalo yenu emva kwenu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lazo zonke izidalwa eziphilayo ezilani, izinyoni lezifuyo lenyamazana zonke zomhlaba ezikanye lani, konke okuphume emkolweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizakumisa isivumelwano sami lani; kakusayikubhujiswa izidalwa zonke ngamanzi kazamcolo, kakusayikuba lozamcolo ukuba abhubhise umhlaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu wathi: Lokhu kuyisibonakaliso sesivumelwano engisenza phakathi kwami lani lazo zonke izidalwa eziphilayo ezikanye lani, kube sezizukulwaneni ezizayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizabeka umchilowamakhosikazi wami eyezini, ube yisibonakaliso sesivumelwano phakathi kwami lomhlaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzakuthi nxa ngibuyisa amayezi phezu komhlaba, umchilowamakhosikazi ubonakale emayezini; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khona ngizakhumbula isivumelwano sami esiphakathi kwami lani lazo zonke izidalwa eziphilayo zenhlobo zonke; amanzi kawasayikuba nguzamcolo abhubhise zonke izidalwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umchilowamakhosikazi uzakuba semayezini, lapho ngiwubona ngizakhumbula isivumelwano esingapheliyo esiphakathi kukaNkulunkulu lazo zonke inyamazana eziphilayo zenhlobo zonke ezisemhlabeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu wathi kuNowa: Lokhu kuyisibonakaliso sesivumelwano engisimise phakathi kwami lakho konke okuphilayo emhlabeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadodana kaNowa aphumayo emkolweni ayengoShemu loHamu loJafethi; uHamu wayenguyise kaKanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yiwo lawo amadodana amathathu kaNowa; umhlaba wonke wagcwaliswa ngabazalwa yiwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNowa waba ngowokuqala ukuba ngumlimi, wahlanyela isivini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanatha iwayini, wadakwa yilo, walala eze ethenteni lakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHamu, uyise kaKanani, wabona ubuze bukayise, watshela abafowabo bobabili ababephandle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OShemu loJafethi bathatha ingubo, bayibeka emahlombe abo bobabili, bangena behamba nyovane, bagubuzela ubuze bukayise; ubuso babo babukhangele emuva ukuba bangaboni ubuze bukayise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNowa eseqaqabukile ekudakweni wezwa lokho indodana yakhe encinyane ebikwenzile kuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.25"
            ]
